  "section_notes": "The final text keeps per-model test results confidential from the public while giving them to purchasers, which respects both NW-1 and HC-1. S2 has no sales bar above 5%, which largely protects Northwind's Hearth 10, and S5 makes recall conditional on a regulator finding rather than automatic at 8 per 100,000, which protects Halcyon's Ember 8. S3 (6-year retrofit) and S4 (36-month suppression) sit within the acceptable ranges."
